tration-openai-new-york-times-ai-copyright/"}]}},{"id":"ws_56f7112f-a4a0-9c6f-9d9b-9c1f2d611e2f_call-33a7566e-4cea-4314-b809-3f200563a693-8","type":"web_search_call","status":"completed","action":{"type":"search","query":"Uber Wayve self-driving taxis London launch","sources":[{"type":"url","url":"https://wayve.ai/press/wayve-uber-launch-autonomous-rides/"},{"type":"url","url":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3ey9vq2q54o"},{"type":"url","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-02/uber-wayve-launch-robotaxi-service-in-london-to-compete-with-waymo"},{"type":"url","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/sep/03/london-first-self-driving-taxis-for-hire-wayve-uber"},{"type":"url","url":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3w07qg43j6o"},{"type":"url","url":"https://investor.uber.com/news-events/news/press-release-details/2026/Wayve-and-Uber-Move-a-Step-Closer-to-Autonomous-Rides-in-London/default.aspx"},{"type":"url","url":"https://www.reuters.com/world/europe/uber-opens-sign-ups-london-robotaxis-ahead-launch-in-months-2026-06-08/"},{"type":"url","url":"https://www.reuters.com/business/uber-ai-firm-wayve-launch-londons-first-robotaxis-2026-09-02/"},{"type":"url","url":"https://www.theverge.com/news/988415/uber-wayve-robotaxi-london-launch"},{"type":"url","url":"https://www.automotiveworld.com/news/uber-and-wayve-prepare-londons-first-robotaxi-service/"}]}},{"id":"tco_56f7112f-a4a0-9c6f-9d9b-9c1f2d611e2f_call-33a7566e-4cea-4314-b809-3f200563a693-7","summary":[],"type":"reasoning","status":"completed"},{"id":"tco_56f7112f-a4a0-9c6f-9d9b-9c1f2d611e2f_call-33a7566e-4cea-4314-b809-3f200563a693-8","summary":[],"type":"reasoning","status":"completed"},{"content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Justice Dept. Sides With OpenAI in New York Times Copyright Suit\",\n      \"summary\": \"美国司法部首次介入纽约时报诉OpenAI版权诉讼，支持AI训练使用公开内容属于合理使用，并强调其对国家安全至关重要。此举可能为全球AI模型训练版权问题树立先例。\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/02/technology/justice-department-openai-copyright-suit.html\",\n      \"source\": \"The New York Times\",\n      \"published_at\": \"2026-09-02T18:41:00Z\",\n      \"tags\": [\"OpenAI\", \"copyright\", \"legal\", \"US government\"],\n      \"importance\": 5\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Google Releases Gemini 3.8 Flash and Cyber Variant\",\n      \"summary\": \"谷歌发布Gemini 3.8 Flash，六周内第三次Flash更新，针对代理工作流和软件工程优化，性能接近更高成本前沿模型。同时推出网络安全专用Cyber版本，通过Fairwind计划向政府和合作伙伴开放。\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/3-8-flash-and-3-8-flash-cyber/\",\n      \"source\": \"Google Blog\",\n      \"published_at\": \"2026-09-02T15:00:00Z\",\n      \"tags\": [\"Google\", \"Gemini\", \"LLM\", \"agents\"],\n      \"importance\": 5\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"NVIDIA Nemotron-3-Ultra Becomes First AI to Outscore Top Human at IOI 2026\",\n      \"summary\": \"NVIDIA的5500亿参数Nemotron-3-Ultra-CC模型在IOI 2026中获得535.4分，首次超越顶尖人类选手的498.27分。该模型在相同时间、提交和网络限制下实现金牌级表现，标志着AI编程能力的重大突破。\",\n      \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.02849\",\n      \"source\": \"arXiv\",\n      \"published_at\": \"2026-09-02T00:00:00Z\",\n      \"tags\": [\"NVIDIA\", \"Nemotron\", \"coding\", \"research\"],\n      \"importance\": 5\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Uber and Wayve Launch UK's First Autonomous Robotaxis in London\",\n      \"summary\": \"Uber与英国AI初创公司Wayve合作，在伦敦推出英国首个商业自动驾驶出租车服务，使用配备Wayve AI Driver的Ford Mustang Mach-E，初期配备安全驾驶员。这是欧洲复杂城市环境中AI自动驾驶的重要商业化里程碑。\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/sep/03/london-first-self-driving-taxis-for-hire-wayve-uber\",\n      \"source\": \"The Guardian\",\n      \"published_at\": \"2026-09-03T05:00:00Z\",\n      \"tags\": [\"Uber\", \"Wayve\", \"autonomous vehicles\", \"robotaxi\"],\n      \"importance\": 4\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenAI Integrates ChatGPT Health with Epic EHR for Clinicians\",\n      \"summary\": \"OpenAI推出ChatGPT Health与Epic电子健康记录系统的只读集成，覆盖超3.25亿患者数据，帮助临床医生总结病历、实验室结果和用药信息。同时新增公共卫生数据插件，连接PubMed等官方来源，推动医疗AI落地。\",\n      \"url\": \"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/01/chatgpt-health-adds-epic-integration-for-clinicians-to-import-patient-data/\",\n      \"source\": \"TechCrunch\",\n      \"published_at\": \"2026-09-01T17:00:00Z\",\n      \"tags\": [\"OpenAI\", \"healthcare\", \"EHR\", \"ChatGPT\"],\n      \"importance\": 4\n    }\n  ]\n}","logprobs":[],"annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/29/us/politics/trump-lawsuits-tracker-takeaways.html","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/29/us/politics/trump-lawsuits-tracker-takeaways.html"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.nytimes.com/spotlight/ai-future-in-motion?page=10","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.nytimes.com/spotlight/ai-future-in-motion?page=10"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.lemonde.fr/en/artificial-intelligence/","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.lemonde.fr/en/artificial-intelligence/"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://ai.google/research/","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://ai.google/research/"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/02/technology/justice-department-openai-copyright-suit.html","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/02/technology/justice-department-openai-copyright-suit.html"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.reuters.com/technology/openai/","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.reuters.com/technology/openai/"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://huggingface.co/papers/2609.02849","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://huggingface.co/papers/2609.02849"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/2025-research-breakthroughs/","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/2025-research-breakthroughs/"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://opena